<p>Use this tab to set details of printing.</p>
<p>Available functions differ depending on the printer or printer driver 
 you are using.</p>
<p aria-level="2" class="T1" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Current Setting</span></p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="image" role="heading">Print Image</p>
<p>Displays a preview image of how the current settings affect the document 
 when it is printed.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" role="heading">Setting Icons</p>
<p>Current settings are displayed using icons. Move your mouse's pointer 
 over icons to see the details.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="list" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Document Size:</span> / <span class="Term-Soft">Print 
 On:</span> / <span class="Term-Soft">Reduce/Enlarge:</span></p>
<p>Displays the document size, paper size, and Reduce/Enlarge settings 
 of the current printer.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="summary" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Settings Summary</span></p>
<p>Opens the <span class="Term-Soft">Settings Summary</span> dialog box. 
 In the <span class="Term-Soft">Settings List</span> tab, shows the details 
 of current settings. In the <span class="Term-Soft">Tray List</span> tab, 
 shows the list of tray settings and displays the printer configuration 
 as an image.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="current" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Register Current Settings...</span></p>
<p>Opens the <span class="Term-Soft">Register Current Settings as One Click 
 Preset</span> dialog box. You can register the current settings as a one 
 click preset with its name and comment.</p>
<p aria-level="2" class="T1" id="menu" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Menu:</span></p>
<p>Select a menu.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" role="heading"><a href="~/Topics/IDH_DJOBSETUP"><span class="Term-Soft">Job Setup</span></a></p>
<p>Use this menu to make settings for print job.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" role="heading"><a href="~/Topics/IDH_DBASIC"><span class="Term-Soft">Basic</span></a></p>
<p>Use this menu to make basic print settings.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" role="heading"><a href="~/Topics/IDH_DPAPER"><span class="Term-Soft">Paper</span></a></p>
<p>Use this menu to make settings about paper sources.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" role="heading"><a href="~/Topics/idh_dcover"><span class="Term-Soft">Cover/Slip/Designate</span></a></p>
<p>Use this menu to make settings for covers, slip sheets, or chapter pages.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" role="heading"><a href="~/Topics/IDH_DDUPLEX"><span class="Term-Soft">2 Sided/Layout/Booklet</span></a></p>
<p>Use this menu to change the layout when printing, and set 2 sided printing.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" role="heading"><a href="~/Topics/idh_dimposition"><span class="Term-Soft">Imposition</span></a></p>
<p>Use this menu to print a document using an imposition function.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" role="heading"><a href="~/Topics/idh_ddeliver"><span class="Term-Soft">Output Settings</span></a></p>
<p>Use this menu to make settings for the output tray or to specify how 
 you want to have prints delivered to the output tray.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" role="heading"><a href="~/Topics/IDH_DFINISH"><span class="Term-Soft">Finishing</span></a></p>
<p>Use this menu to specify how you want to finish prints after printing.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" role="heading"><a href="~/Topics/IDH_DPRINT_QLT"><span class="Term-Soft">Print Quality:Standard</span></a></p>
<p>Use this menu to adjust the standard settings that can affect the output 
 quality of the print jobs.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" role="heading"><a href="~/Topics/idh_dprint_qlt_ad"><span class="Term-Soft">Print 
 Quality:Advanced</span></a></p>
<p>Use this menu to adjust the advanced settings that can affect the output 
 quality of the print jobs.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" role="heading"><a href="~/Topics/IDH_DEFFECTS"><span class="Term-Soft">Effects</span></a></p>
<p>Use this menu to print a watermark text in a document.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" role="heading"><a href="~/Topics/PS_CS/IDH_DDRIVER_OPTION"><span class="Term-Soft">Driver 
 Options</span></a></p>
<p>Use this menu to provide functions concerned with controls peculiar 
 to the driver.</p>
